# Cursor Router -> `AGENTS.md` & `.agent/`

This repository does not store long-term memory or domain rules in proprietary `.mdc` files. Before executing any task:

1. Read **[`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md)** at the repository root for safety boundaries, Git policy, and the on-demand task routing table.
2. Load the matching stage skill from **[`.agent/skills/<skill-name>/SKILL.md`](../../.agent/skills/)** and the relevant domain rule from **[`.agent/rules/<topic>.md`](../../.agent/rules/)**.
3. Never read, print, or commit `src/sections/header.private.tex`. Add any new long-term memory or workflow rules to `.agent/rules/` or `AGENTS.md`, never to this `.mdc` router.
